cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Chile Digital Inclusion, please cite the repository and the original data sources documented for each layer."
title: "Chile Digital Inclusion"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Elgueta Godoy"
    given-names: "Sebastián"
repository-code: "https://github.com/selguetagodoy/Chile-Digital-Inclusion"
url: "https://github.com/selguetagodoy/Chile-Digital-Inclusion"
date-released: 2026-08-14
abstract: >-
  Open analytical repository for digital inclusion in Chile integrating
  communal household connectivity and social context, SUBTEL survey and
  sector evidence, public 4G/5G network point records, and observed network
  performance from Ookla Open Data. Statistical universes are kept separate
  and the public repository excludes proprietary indices and weighting models.
keywords:
  - digital inclusion
  - digital divide
  - Chile
  - telecommunications
  - public policy
  - 5G
  - broadband
  - data infrastructure
  - territorial analysis
